{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination"],"title":"Destinations","anchor":"Destinations"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/loggingdestinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that writes each tracked event to a swift-log "},{"code":"Logger","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"LoggingDestinations"}],"externalID":"LoggingDestinations","roleHeading":"Framework","title":"LoggingDestinations","role":"collection"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" turns each record into one log entry at the level you choose, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"info"},{"type":"text","text":" by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default. The message is the event’s name. The metadata holds the event’s description under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"type":"text","text":", the time it was tracked under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event.timestamp"},{"type":"text","text":", its call site under OpenTelemetry’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"type":"text","text":" names, and every value of its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" under the value’s key name. The entry’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own file, function and line are the event’s call site, so a handler that prints them points at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"type":"text","text":" call rather than at this module."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use it to see what is tracked beside the rest of your logs, in development or in a log pipeline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you already run. It writes the event’s description, in which a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" property prints as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<redacted>"},{"type":"text","text":". To add events to traces instead, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SpanEventDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TracingDestinations"},{"type":"text","text":" module; to send them to a server, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestinations"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: LoggerDestination(logger: logger, level: .debug)",")","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The umbrella guide on this area is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://LoggingDestinations/documentation/LoggingDestinations":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that writes each tracked event to a swift-log "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Logger"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"LoggingDestinations","url":"\/documentation\/loggingdestinations"},"doc://LoggingDestinations/documentation/LoggingDestinations/LoggerDestination":{"title":"LoggerDestination","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LoggerDestination"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination","url":"\/documentation\/loggingdestinations\/loggerdestination","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that writes each event to a swift-log ","type":"text"},{"code":"Logger","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LoggerDestination"}]},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choosing Destinations"}],"title":"Choosing Destinations","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"}}}